      "parent": "s5",
      "text": "二則閘",
      "color": null,
      "order": 1,
      "note": "Rule of Two：不可信輸入 × 機敏資料 × 改變狀態"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5c",
      "parent": "s5",
      "text": "覆蓋矩陣",
      "color": null,
      "order": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "h4",
      "parent": "h",
      "text": "憑證路徑",
      "color": null,
      "order": 3,
      "note": "~/.ssh、~/.aws、.env*、金鑰檔；含 glob（ASI03、LLM02:2026）"
    },
    {
      "id": "h5",
      "parent": "h",
      "text": "解析連結",
      "color": null,
      "order": 4,
      "note": "$.fs.stat realPath，擋 repo 內指向憑證的 symlink"
    },
    {
      "id": "g5",
      "parent": "g",
      "text": "提示載體",
      "color": null,
      "order": 4,
      "note": "Unicode tag 隱寫（解碼）、零寬／bidi（LLM01:2026）"
    },
    {
      "id": "g6",
      "parent": "g",
      "text": "代理權限",
      "color": null,
      "order": 5,
      "note": "bypassPermissions、autoApprove、萬用清單、REPL 工具（LLM03:2026、ASI02/05）"
    },
    {
      "id": "g7",
      "parent": "g",
      "text": "MCP設定",
      "color": null,
      "order": 6,
      "note": "未鎖版本、內嵌密鑰、明文傳輸（ASI04/07）"
    },
    {
      "id": "g8",
      "parent": "g",
      "text": "嚴格模式",
      "color": null,
      "order": 7,
      "note": "allow 標記預設忽略（--honor-markers 才採用，永不隱藏 secret／隱形字元）；skipped 皆列報，結束碼 3＝INCOMPLETE"
    },
